Package: ps3-games-integration
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Breaks: ps3-desktop (<< 0.893)
Replaces: ps3-desktop (<< 0.893)
Description: Walnut's menu entries and settings for the PS3's games
 The games' integration into the PS3 desktop, from the games database (gamedb desktop/): menu
 entries that start each game's modes through ps3-game (game mode), shown only when the game is
 installed; the PS3 defaults some games read from system-wide files (e.g. OpenArena's); the games'
 own menu entries that ours stand for, diverted out of the menu; the list of old per-user files
 ps3-migrate-home tidies up.
